 "rows": {
  "card": "#### G2-25 · HUD vehicle-weapons API   S · deps: G2-11 · serves: HUD-2, WPN-12\nIn: decompiled `ui/hud.gfx` (260 scripts), `T6_HUD_CAMERA.md`.\nDo: document `InitVehicleWeapons` / `UpdateVehicleWeapons` arguments (slot count, icon id,\nammo/heat/cooldown), the lock-on HUD used by `w609`/`w612`/`w613`, and how the entity feeds them\n(weapon id → icon).\nOut: `Research/JC3Grab/JC3_HUD_WEAPONS.md`.\nDone: each BmAK HUD element in WPN-12 has a JC3 element or a stated absence.",
  "t_hud5": {
   "current": "T6_HUD_CAMERA.md section 1a (completed by T-19, 2026-10-28)",
   "date": "2026-10-27",
   "sha256": "e41b8a5849f00e550d354a17c83367ef79d7675b14c4e10e3b036fb4e1ab4cb9",
   "source": "Working/Translation/T6_HUD_CAMERA.md",
   "text": "| T-HUD5 | `UC_SetCannonCoolDown(0…4)`, heavy reticle, special weapon states | `InitVehicleWeapons` / `UpdateVehicleWeapons` (2 slots) | categorical | no weapon component on the mod | **blocked**: the HUD supports it, the entity does not | decoded | fire the cannon, reticle cooldown |"
  },
  "wpn12": "HUD: weapon slots, reticle, cannon cooldown, Vulcan heat, missile lock | `HUD_INTERFACES.json` (`UC_SetCannonCoolDown` …) | `hud.gfx` `InitVehicleWeapons`/`UpdateVehicleWeapons` (T-HUD5)"
 },
